@startuml GoldPlanner_UI_Event_Dependencies
title GoldPlanner - UI Event Dependencies
left to right direction

rectangle "GoldPlanner Domain Events" {
  component "GOAL_UPDATED" as GoalUpdated
  component "HISTORY_TOTAL_UPDATED" as HistoryUpdated
}
rectangle "Blizzard Frame Events" {
  component "QUEST_LOG_UPDATE" as QuestLogUpdate
  component "PLAYER_LOGIN" as PlayerLogin
}
rectangle "UI Components" {
  component "Overview" as Overview
  component "StatsBox" as StatsBox
  component "ProgressBar" as ProgressBar
  component "WorldQuests" as WorldQuests
  component "Settings" as Settings
  component "Dashboard" as Dashboard
}

GoalUpdated --> Overview : RegisterCallback()
HistoryUpdated --> Overview : RegisterCallback()
GoalUpdated --> StatsBox : RegisterCallback()
HistoryUpdated --> StatsBox : RegisterCallback()
GoalUpdated --> ProgressBar : RegisterCallback()
HistoryUpdated --> ProgressBar : RegisterCallback()
QuestLogUpdate --> WorldQuests : RegisterFrameEventAndCallback()
PlayerLogin --> Settings : Build()
PlayerLogin --> Dashboard : Build()
PlayerLogin --> StatsBox : Build()
PlayerLogin --> ProgressBar : Build()

note right of Overview
Initial rendering occurs during Build().
Subsequent domain changes use callbacks.
end note

note bottom of QuestLogUpdate
WorldQuests directly owns QUEST_LOG_UPDATE.
This is the primary GOL-32 UI-local event case.
end note
@enduml
